                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.54/1987: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-05-24T00:00:00+09:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1921—12
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 24—6:10 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>182. My 172, May 21, noon.<anchor n="49" xml:id="d702-f1"/> Abbott and Davis
                    arrived Chita 20th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
